      "date": "2026-02-12T19:59:50.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.68 (vs ₹0.73 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.68 (up from ₹0.73 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹341.2m (up 4.5% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹6.50m (up 124% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 1.9% (up from 0.9% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 119% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 5% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
